  "description": "Details of condition 5 (Details of integral nesting bricks) as required by planning permission ref: 25/AP/1941 granted on 29.10.2025 for: (Extension and external alterations to the existing building involving changes to entrances, doors, windows, fixed panel, materials, fire exits, ramps, balconies and balustrade and signage to carry out the folllowing:\r\r-Removal of existing external fire exit stair and its replacement with part single, part two-storey extension with biodiverse  roof and 1 AOV,\r-New main entrance to the Youth Centre with new ramp  \r-New signage to Brandon Youth Centre on NE elevation.  \r-Louvre system, to hide external units on plant room roof,\r-Vertical risers to be cladded in exterior grade Acupanel in oak effect. \r-New fire exit to the Youth Centre on NW elevation, \r-Replace existing main entrance to the Brandon Youth Centre (NE elevation) to provide a new entrance to the Brandon Library with a new ramp.\r- Existing Library entrance to be replaced with a double-glazed fixed panel. \r- Enclosure of the existing two balcony on the NW elevation and reintegrate the space into the internal lobby.\r-Replace the current balustrade with new glazed panels, to coordinate with existing elevation.\r-Replace existing glazing with new glazing and new filler panels above,\r-Redecorate existing double-glazed glazing framework black, to coordinate with the new overall design. \r-Existing Mammoth Logo to be retained on NE elevation)\r"
